# 换行符统一策略：仓库内统一存 LF，避免 Windows 上反复出现
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告，也避免跨平台协作产生无意义 diff。
* text=auto

# 前端构建产物按二进制处理，不做换行转换
travel_plan_agent/webui/** binary

# 二进制资源
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.onnx binary
*.safetensors binary
*.bin binary
*.h5 binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite3 binary
